<html>

<head>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    h2 {
      color: #2c3e50;
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin: 10px 0;
    }

    ul {
      list-style-type: none;
      padding: 0;
    }

    li {
      margin: 5px 0;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    strong {
      color: #2980b9;
    }

    a {
      color: #2980b9;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #7f8c8d;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <h2>Hello <em>{{leader.first_name}} {{leader.last_name}}</em>,</h2>
  <p>I am pleased to inform you that you have been added to a capstone project as the leader with the following details:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Project Name:</strong> {{projectDetails.name}}</li>
    <li><strong>Description:</strong> {{projectDetails.description}}</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To start working on your capstone project, please click on the following link:
    <a href='{{start_url}}'>Access Project</a>
  </p>
  <p>If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact me.</p>
  <p>Best regards,<br />
    Supervising Lecturer
    {{supervisor_name}}</p>
  <p class='footer'>© {{year}} FPT University. All rights reserved.</p>
</body>

</html>